# Binary Assets
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# No custom merge drivers (ADR-2532): GitHub ignores them when it decides whether a PR can merge, and the
# generated GxP reports are kept conflict-free by never committing them on feature branches. Never use merge=union.

# Checksum-verified standards seed content: never normalise line endings (Seed/manifest.json pins each file's SHA-256)
packages/kernel/src/Cadence.Standards/Seed/*.json -text
packages/kernel/src/Cadence.Standards/Blocks/*.json -text
